		(property "DesignNote" "Unique PH5, four contacts only; position5NC no wire. Pin1 is supplied through common R179330R, in addition to the three cathode resistors. Differs from PH4 idle, XH4 switch and VH3 flex. Internal harness to ordinary common-anode LED; not a sealed connector/window qualification. A6 conditional development draft, no fabrication/physical qualification."
