		(property "DesignNote" "User-selected 16MB flash / 8MB PSRAM. 44-pin order from saved supplier pinout. Socket row spacing 22.86mm PROVISIONAL. Inward antenna extension 10mm; module PCB underside +8.5mm above carrier top is an assumed socket stack. Internal RGB pin is disputed (47 pinout / 48 schematic). Use separate RGB LED on GPIO38, socket pad32; no engine pulses. Verify actual board fit and RF performance before fabrication/use. A5 adds GPIO3 idle service through J21 and permanent R154 bias; actual eFuse/JTAG routing and loaded output behavior remain unverified. A6 GPIO38 only receives protected flex candidate; oldGPIO38 RMT/LED builds incompatible. Use compact_n16r8_flex_dev only; engine outputs inhibited. A7 adds permanent GPIO45 bias and a shared ZH5 idle/boost optical-input header at J21. Actual strapping/eFuse/fit and physical writes remain unqualified/inhibited."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "5df7c595-c170-4c73-80ed-ecaadd3b8fde")
			(effects
